  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/VsNs9xP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F411xGo.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Haubna\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EOPNsK1.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftphysicsmod.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6iCc4ux.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h1><strong>新版仅于官方网站提供</strong></h1><p>⠀</p><h3><strong>全新的沉浸式体验</strong></h3><p>踏入前所未见的新世界。洞穴崩塌、交互式布娃娃物理、物品物理等更多精彩内容等着你！\n⠀\n⠀</p><h3><strong>支持平台</strong></h3><p>Windows、Linux和MacOS（M1/M2芯片仅支持Minecraft 1.20及以上版本，其他版本需启用兼容模式：<a href=\"https://github.com/haubna/PhysicsMod/issues/461#issuecomment-1332775496\" rel=\"nofollow\">教程</a>）！\n⠀\n⠀</p><h3><strong>生物</strong></h3><p>每位物理狂热者的最爱部分。所有原版Minecraft生物均支持布娃娃物理、碎裂效果及方块化版本！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/637/310/172/mob_ragdolls.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/638/310/172/mob_blocky.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/639/310/172/mob_fracturing.png\" alt=\"\">\n⠀\n⠀</p><h3><strong>方块</strong></h3><p>让Minecraft世界中的方块碎裂成片！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/640/310/172/block_fractured.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/641/310/172/block_particles.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/649/93/310/172/block_voxels.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/642/310/172/block_blocky.png\" alt=\"\">\n⠀\n⠀</p><h3><strong>其他功能</strong></h3><p>厌倦了漂浮的物品？试试物品物理！重力？月球？火星？冥王星？地球？随心所欲更改！想测试你的电脑极限？看看它能在崩塌结构中坚持多久！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/643/310/172/custom_gravity.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/644/310/172/item_physics.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/645/310/172/collapsing_structures.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
